<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Grupo Carso started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Grupo Carso started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe General Securities Corp analyst Frederick Searby started coverage of Mexican conglomerate Grupo Carso SA de CV with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Carso has been a consistent creator of shareholder value,&quot; he wrote in a report. &quot;... If you are a believer in Mexico, then you have to own this stock.&quot;</p>
<p>-- He set a December 1997 price target of $7.78, giving the stock a potential increase of 22.1 percent from current levels.</p>
<p>((-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, 212 859-1879))</p>
